      536.16,
      303.69,
      570.23
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 01Name of land: Madakoratuwa; Description: Home Garden,Mixed Cultivation is there; Claimed by: Sitina Maluwa Guruge",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
